Apple has made it so that you can connect your Apple Watch to your iPhone in order to charge it, and do other things with the two devices. So, you can leave the watch connected to your iPhone, and that way it'll be able to track your stats just fine. Unfortunately, it's difficult to get the stats onto the Apple Watch.
What you need:
- Apple Watch or any other 40mm watch that's not a Series 1;
- An iPhone with iOS 13.3 beta 3;
- The Apple Watch
